// full (the block; was full_h, run stg_llama3_full_h): the block with the 28 Oct confirmed stage levers (X from HBM). fa/llama3_prefill: Llama-3-8B's grouped-query attention (32 query / 8 key-value heads of 128, hidden 4096, synthetic
// weights of the model's shapes) over a fresh causal 256-token prompt on 16 + 4 chiplets, the FA block's Llama
// variant; the driver is ../../llama3/common/llama3_attn_mc.py, shared with the full layer (llama3/prefill/layer).
// Was llama3/prefill_tiny/attn_sw (its run keeps the name stg_poc_attn_sw in sweep/llm_layer/llama3_prefill:
// PASS 14/14, 1,186.3 us = 56.7 % MAC). Its ancestors below.
// attn_sw: attn4f with the FA block's stage-2 software (fa_prefill_mc.py's switches): cfg_reuse, gemm_shape_l1,
// gemm_reuse, gemm_cfg_ahead, fa_cfg_ahead, mask_c. Stage 5's Llama-3-8B GQA attention at 256 tokens.
// attn4f: attn4 under the static L1 planner's fix: a queued GEMM's wait is a user of every buffer its start names
// (bingo_liveness RULE 1). attn4 FAILED y because cluster 1's V transpose (la_vt) took the bytes of pass 0's x while the
// K/V projections still streamed it.
// attn4: the attention block alone with layer11's attention (bc 64, rope_pairs chunks, wo_cols, restream, l3_overlay)
// and attn.kv_split, y checked on the root by pass (no y_scatter): which part of kv_split's result is wrong
// (prefill_tiny/layer11, 12, 13, 15 FAILED y tile 8).
{
  num_chiplets: 16
  num_clusters: 2
  seed: 1
  tokens: 256
  rows: 64
  bc: 64
  dn_cols: 256
  wbits: 4
  w4_paired: true
  w_chunk_bytes: 65536
  w_buffers: 2
  load_ahead: true
  wo_cols: true
  wo_slice: 128
  rope_pairs: chunks
  restream: true
  l3_overlay: true
  kv_split: true
  weight_ring: { slots: 8, batch: 4, policy: 1, head: 4, batch_head: 1 }
  bcast: bcast_l1
  reduce: chain
  sync: edge
  static_l1: true
  compact_id_maps: true
  gid_lists: true
  per_chip_image: true
  desc_in_image: true
  l1_capacity: 990000
  d2d_ddr: true
  d2d_rx_yield: [255, 0]
  remote_broadcast: false
  // the root cluster 0's first query tile and the pass's 64 keys (rows 16-63 are what tile 0 of y never reads),
  // then every pass's y at its head, middle and tail
  checks: stages
  cfg_reuse: true
  gemm_shape_l1: true
  gemm_reuse: true
  gemm_cfg_ahead: true
  fa_cfg_ahead: true
  mask_c: true,
  // the confirmed stage levers (28 Oct): X from HBM with the root's prefetch split around it (stage1234_xp), the
  // sweep's o~ straight into o8 and its geometry on the xDMA (stage5_og), W_O by columns with the weights loaded
  // ahead and the gather on the xDMA (stage678_oe without o_overlap: in the block, pass i + 1's o8 waits for that
  // pass's x fetch, which follows pass i's y stores on the DM core, so o_overlap's order closes a cycle)
  x_bcast: "memchip",
  x_pf_split: true,
  ot8_fused: true,
  sm_geom_xdma: true,
  wo_load_ahead: true,
  y_scatter: true,
  wo_early: true,
  o_get_xdma: true
}
